family Tree
category planting
host floor
ifc IfcGeographicElement NOTDEFINED
# Species table: one type per tree, a few per species with another seed and size, so
# neighbours differ. Form: 0 round 1 oval 2 conical 3 columnar 4 weeping 5 palm 6 vase
# 7 spreading. Group is for the generator: 0 broadleaf 1 conifer 2 columnar 3 weeping
# 4 palm 5 small 6 spreading; Weight 0 keeps a type out of generated sites. Leaf is the
# foliage fullness (0 bare, 1 full); Seed fixes the branching and the uneven crown.
# Season is when the type stands in leaf: 0 summer 1 autumn 2 winter (bare) 3 spring, 4 all
# year (evergreens); a deciduous species has one type per season with the same seed.
# Scale (instance value) sizes the whole tree; the generator jitters it per tree. MinClear floors
# the clear trunk under the crown (the generator sets it from site.tree_min_clear). The clear
# trunk never exceeds 0.9 of the height, so a short tree or a long Clear still builds.
param Form int type 0
param Height length type 8000mm
param Crown length type 4000mm
param Trunk length type 300mm
param Clear length type 2500mm
param Leaf number type 1
param Seed int type 1
param Scale number instance 1
param MinClear length instance 0mm
param Group int type 0
param Weight number type 1
param Season int type 0
param Bark material type "Bark Brown"
param Leaves material type "Foliage Green"
param Inner material type "Foliage Shade"
